    {
      "id": "openrouter",
      "reason": "the /models catalogue is a survivor set - delisted models vanish, so a reconstructed 30d count is biased low the further back it reaches (only 9 of 454 listed models carry a 2023 created date). Calibrating live readings against a downward-biased history would bias the live score upward, which is a confident number over a compromised pipe."
